# =============================================
# Raw 3D exports (archive material, not repo material)
# =============================================
# ~15 MB each straight out of the authoring tool. `npm run models:optimize`
# turns these into the committed client/public/models/*-hq.glb / *-lq.glb
# (~26x smaller). Keep the raws in cloud storage, not in git.
client/models-source/

